<title>HONG KONG: CIBC CEF sets warrants on Hongkong Land.</title>
<headline>CIBC CEF sets warrants on Hongkong Land.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Imperial Bank of Commerce, London Branch, said on Thursday it issued 110 million American-style call warrants on Hongkong Land Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	US$2.385	   PREMIUM	 12.8 PCT</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    US$2.65	    GEARING	 4.39X</p>
<p> MATURITY	    22.MAY.98	  MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.468 (using FX rate of 7.74)</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
